---
title: SEQ-01 — Accounts, profile and consent (UC-01–UC-05)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Reader or Teacher
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant IdP as Identity Provider
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Class as Class Service
    participant DB as Database
    alt UC-01 Register
        User->>App: Choose Reader or Teacher, enter name and email
        opt Teacher
            User->>App: Enter required school name
        end
        alt Required field missing
            App-->>User: Refuse registration
        else Valid fields
            App->>IdP: Register credentials
            alt Email used or provider unavailable
                IdP-->>App: Reject or unavailable
                App-->>User: No account created
            else Identity created
                IdP-->>App: Identity subject
                App->>Account: registerOrUpdateAccount(type, profile, subject)
                Account->>DB: Store Account and conditional TeacherDetail
                Note over DB: One fixed type, Arabic default, no Itqan password
                Account-->>App: Account created
                App-->>User: Open Reader or Teacher area, Teacher gets Al-Mu'allim
            end
        end
    else UC-02 Login
        User->>App: Sign in
        App->>IdP: Authenticate credentials
        alt Wrong credentials or provider unavailable
            IdP-->>App: Reject or unavailable
            App-->>User: Stay logged out
        else Authenticated
            IdP-->>App: Identity subject
            App->>Account: Get matching Account
            Account->>DB: Read fixed account type
            Account-->>App: Reader or Teacher role
            App-->>User: Open matching area, deny wrong-role screens and data
        end
    else UC-04 Manage profile
        User->>App: Open profile
        App->>Account: Get name, email, language and optional school name
        Account->>DB: Read Account and conditional TeacherDetail
        Account-->>App: Profile with email read-only here
        User->>App: Edit name, ar/en language or Teacher school name
        alt Email or credential change
            App-->>User: Use Identity Provider
        else Required name empty
            App-->>User: Refuse change
        else Valid profile change
            App->>Account: registerOrUpdateAccount(profile changes)
            Account->>DB: Save profile
            App-->>User: Apply language now and after login on another device
        end
    else UC-05 Privacy and consent
        User->>App: Open Privacy
        App->>Account: getStoredDataSummary(user)
        Account->>DB: Read stored categories and Reader consent dates
        Account-->>App: Summary, visibility and two Reader purposes
        App-->>User: Show what is stored and who can see it
        alt Reader grants or regrants a purpose
            User->>App: Grant recitation or teacher sharing
            App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(grant, purpose)
            Account->>DB: Insert new dated ConsentRecord
            Note over DB: One active grant per Reader and purpose, keep withdrawn history
        else Reader withdraws recitation consent
            User->>App: Withdraw recitation consent
            App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(withdraw, recitation)
            Account->>DB: Date withdrawal, block new sessions, keep results
        else Reader withdraws teacher-sharing consent
            User->>App: Withdraw teacher-sharing consent
            App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(withdraw, teacher sharing)
            Account->>Class: Apply effect to every active Enrolment
            Account->>DB: Atomically date withdrawal and end active Enrolments
            Note over DB: End reason consent withdrawn, Teacher access stops
        else Profile correction or deletion requested
            App-->>User: Profile correction via UC-04 or deletion via UC-06 / SEQ-06
            Note over App: System-generated Sessions and Mistakes cannot be edited
        end
        App-->>User: Show updated status and dates
    else UC-03 Logout
        alt User chooses Logout
            User->>App: Logout
        else Inactivity timeout outside recitation
            App->>App: Expire login session
        end
        opt Explicit logout during active recitation
            App->>App: End Session interrupted via SEQ-02
        end
        App->>IdP: Logout
        App-->>User: Show login screen, deny protected data
    end
